    "source_text": "モルフォールは冷静で知的な人ばかりだったの\nそれが、侵食に脅かされてからは\n噂をしたり、言い合いばかりでなんだか\nとっても陰気な感じ――\n誰か、スカッと晴らしてきてくれないかな",
    "translated_text": "Morfaul was once home to none but calm, intellectual folk. But since the infection threatened it, they do naught but spread rumors and argue— &#x27;tis a terribly gloomy atmosphere now. I wish someone would come and clear the air.",
